{
  "about": "The models 4CE routes between. Adding a model is adding an entry here and running install.py: the router reads capabilities from this file, so no code changes. size_gb is the weights as the model server reports them; the KV cache for the context comes on top. Keep contexts at 8192 on a 6 GB GPU. This is the laptop profile, the one every measurement in the docs was taken on; larger machines have profiles in profiles/, installed with install.py --profile.",
